How funny it is.

00:05:40.020 --> 00:05:40.853
- Let's talk about the cast.

00:05:40.853 --> 00:05:43.470
We've had a few cast members
from the show on the show.

00:05:43.470 --> 00:05:45.000
It's such a great cast.
- [Ted] It is.

00:05:45.000 --> 00:05:45.833
- Is it a fun-

00:05:45.833 --> 00:05:46.770
Do y'all have really good chemistry?

00:05:46.770 --> 00:05:49.230
